ndicated due to potential for hyperkalemia .'\r\nMismatch for PASSAGE_0055:\r\nptext (repr): 'with ivabradine is contraindicated due to potential for bradycardia or conduction disturbances .\\n\\n||'\r\nchunk (repr): 'ion with ivabradine is contraindicated due to potential for bradycardia or conduction disturbances .'\r\n"]
