[88.134933, "o", "  Severe, life-threatening, and/or fatal adverse reactions due to drug interactions have been reported in patients treated\r\n  Prior to prescribing PAXLOVID, review all medications taken by the patient to assess potential drug-drug interactions an\r\n  Consider the benefit of PAXLOVID treatment in reducing hospitalization and death, and whether the risk of potential drug\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n"]
