[219.77337, "o", "        \"answer\": \"Important warnings and precautions associated with Paxlovid are: risk of serious, life-threatening, or fatal adverse reactions due to drug interactions (strong CYP3A inhibition by ritonavir, or loss of therapeutic effect and possible resistance due to CYP3A induction); hypersensitivity reactions (including anaphylaxis, toxic epidermal necrolysis, Stevens-Johnson syndrome; discontinue immediately if signs occur); hepatotoxicity (hepatic transaminase elevations, clinical hepatitis, jaundice; caution in pre-existing liver disease or liver enzyme abnormalities); and risk of HIV-1 resistance development in individuals with uncontrolled or undiagnosed HIV-1 infection.\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\ret_id\": \"8a99d6d6-fd9e-45bb-b1bf-48c7f761232a\",\r\n                \"passage_id\": \"PASSAGE_0015\",\r\n                \"section\": \"\u001b[?2004h>         \"citations\": [\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
